            "review_title": "Review at Lees Noodle Kitchen",
            "review_text": "Cigaroftheday\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam123 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem!\nMay 2019 • Friends\nThis restaurant is food is on point. Number five on their menu is there.noodle. It is recommended you eat it dry not wet. Food is actually very good which I was shocked. It definitely reminds me of my trip to main land China, not Chinatown. Very quiet and small restaurant seats probably 25 people. This restaurant is a total hidden gem. This establishment is surrounded by mega homes on a quiet street in district 2. After reading some of the reviews I personally think it’s better that you order the food and eat it here instead of taking it away, togo or even delivery. Super happy I made the trip here.\nRead more\nWritten May 23, 2019",
